  "system": {
    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p> In a classic predatory disemboweling move, your foe catches you in the side, raking its natural killing tools across your belly. Your abdominal wall is pierced and a pink loop of intestine starts peeking out of the wound.</p> <p><strong>Effects:</strong> Gain @Condition[Stunned] (2). You must drop anything held in one hand to hold your intestines in place until you’ve received Medical Attention. Also, you contract a Festering Wound. \n Until you’ve had Surgery you are unable to recover 2 of your lost Wounds.</p>"
    },
